{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach, take, inspect, move, then perform task, else scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = InspectObjectColor    /> <Action ID = MoveToDesignatedLocation    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
